; The jsonschema-benchmark protocol program for the OCaml evaluator. It takes the library from the workspace it is
; built in (see README.md). The compiler's flags are dune's defaults for the release profile, with nothing added: no
; -O3 and no -unboxed-types, which only a compiler built with flambda takes, and no -unsafe.

(executable
 (name corvus_ocaml_benchmark)
 (foreign_stubs
  (language c)
  (names clock_stubs))
 (libraries corvus-json-schema))
